// QUERY: Unified Attack Timeline Builder
// MITRE: Multiple Tactics
// DESCRIPTION: Build a chronological timeline of all attacker activity
//              across Identity, Endpoint, Cloud, and Data tables
// SEVERITY: Investigation Tool
// ============================================

